Question 2: What happens to the acceleration of the constituent objects in a closed system if an external force acts on the system?
Answer: The center of mass of the system will experience an acceleration proportional to the magnitude of the external force divided by the mass of the system, while the constituent objects will accelerate with respect to each other.
